<title>USA: Texaco, Oxy awarded Bohai Bay acerage.</title>
<headline>Texaco, Oxy awarded Bohai Bay acerage.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco China BV Inc and Occidental Eastern Inc have signed a contract with the China National Offshore Oil Corp for the exploration of contract area 9/18 in China's Bohai Bay, Texaco Inc said.</p>
<p>Texaco China is a Texaco Inc subsidiary while Occidental Eastern is a subsidiary of Occidental Petroleum Corp.</p>
<p>Each company owns a 50 percent interest in the rights to the block located adjacent to Texaco's 100 percent owned 11/19 offshore block, the company. Said. Texaco will be the operator for the venture. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
